00:06:01.858 --> 00:06:05.192
José Mujica, Eleuterio Fernández
Huidobro and Mauricio Rosencof.


00:06:06.942 --> 00:06:08.233
Take them away.


00:06:19.025 --> 00:06:21.525
Come on, let's go!


00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:23.983
Come on, keep walking!


00:06:25.483 --> 00:06:26.775
Inside!


00:06:53.192 --> 00:06:55.358
Hold him there.


00:06:55.442 --> 00:06:56.733
Soak it in gasoline.


00:06:56.900 --> 00:06:58.567
More, more...


00:06:58.733 --> 00:07:01.233
